2591	    /// Refresh the daemon's authoritative cross-session work snapshots.
2592	    ///
2593	    /// This intentionally polls the existing read-only request and permission
2594	    /// registries instead of opening an SSE pair per background session. Each
2595	    /// signal keeps its last good value when its endpoint or decoder fails, so
2596	    /// a transient poll cannot erase real attention from the Island.
